{
  "_schema": "phantasie.graphics-pack/v1",
  "_note": "Commodore 64 Phantasie III art (v1.0 / v1.2; the p3-c64 import, P3C64Art; reverse-engineering/c64/phantasie3/GRAPHICS.md). III's own engine, not I / II's. Monsters: MONSTERS' sprite blocks by record byte 27, colours from PHANT.OBJ's tables (multicolour or hires), a giant two sprites high; portraits: HEROSPRITES' sets, a Monk / Ranger / Priest / Wizard by class (portrait.class.*), a Thief / Fighter by race; the title TITLE (Koala); the town strip PTOWN1; the map PSET0's characters by DATA's tile tables; the defeat and the gods' pictures TOT / GUT / SCHLECHT. Colours: Colodore (VICE colodore.vpl). Text: the remaster 5x7 font (the C64's sets are in font/).",
