  "_portraits": "portrait.{race}: HEROSPRITES set PHANT.OBJ $1DFE[race] in colour $1E0E[race], the figure a Thief or Fighter shows; portrait.class.{class}: set $1DF2[class] in colour $1DF8[class] for a Monk, Ranger, Priest or Wizard (drawn before the race's) [C]. Hires, frames idle / attacking (/ casting, not drawn). The elemental: the Mud Elemental's monster picture ($B2) in its kind's colour (Air 1, Mist 14, Mud 8); the pack shows Air's [~].",
  "sid_sounds": {
    "_note": "s228 (GRAPHICS.md, the sound) [C]: SND ($126E, 6502) as PHANT.OBJ's fights call it, every write at its CPU cycle (PAL). fight.miss: entry1 ($12A8), a member's or a monster's miss (noise, the gate left on). fight.hit: entry2 ($12C2) with A = $42, any damaging hit, then 10 jiffies. fight.ping: entry0 ($127D) with A = $90, $B0, $90, 13 frames apart, before each hit of FIREFLASH, MINDBLAST or FLAMEBOLT. fight.death: entry4 ($12E2), a member's --DEATH--. entry0's gate is on for 6 cycles (attack 0): near silent [~]. Read on v1.0's PHANT.OBJ; v1.2's SND is the same and its PHANT.OBJ makes the same calls 3 bytes later, so its hit's A is $45 (this pack keeps v1.0's $42) [~].",
